{"_v":1,"id":"the-hunger-games-on-stage-west-end-2025","bd":{"positive":1,"mixed":3,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Arifa Akbar","o":"The Guardian","s":66,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2025/nov/13/the-hunger-games-on-stage-review-thundering-fight-to-the-death-in-a-dazzling-dystopia","d":"2025-11-13","q":"The production bursts into life in the second half, when the Tributes find themselves in the killing field."},{"cn":"Holly O'Mahony","o":"The Stage","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/reviews/the-hunger-games-on-stage-review-troubadour-canary-wharf-theatre-london","d":"2025-11-13","q":"There's plenty here to impress fans of the franchise, and the whole production is a feat of athleticism from its young cast."},{"cn":"Andrzej Lukowski","o":"Time Out London","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/news/review-the-hunger-games-on-stage-111225","d":"2025-11-12","q":"But it's solid, and I found it hard not to admire the quixotic but skilled attempt to translate something so action-packed to the stage."},{"cn":"Cindy Marcolina","o":"BroadwayWorld","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":3,"u":"https://www.broadwayworld.com/article/Review-THE-HUNGER-GAMES-ON-STAGE-Canary-Wharf-Troubadour-Theatre-20251113","d":"2025-11-13","q":"Unfortunately, it's also a soulless incarnation."},{"cn":"Greg Stewart","o":"Theatre Weekly","s":40,"b":"Negative","t":3,"u":"https://theatreweekly.com/review-the-hunger-games-on-stage-at-troubadour-canary-wharf-theatre/","d":"2025-11-13","q":"Despite its visual bravado, this production rarely hits the emotional bullseye."}],"hi":"https://images.ctfassets.net/6pezt69ih962/5rukhPAh7E8SvoWM8HYoov/1f66dd10369a83e16fdd6bdc63618973/THG_TTG_ASSETS_FEB26_1440x580.jpg?fm=webp&q=90"}